<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3668] Can&apos;t hide Spark Jobs (Spark UI) button</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3668</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Hi,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In Zeppelin 0.8.0 I can&apos;t manage to hide &quot;Spark Jobs&quot; / Spark UI in our Notes after upgrading from 0.7.3.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I did a bit of digging and I&#160;could see if &quot;spark.ui.enabled&quot; is set to false the button shouldn&apos;t be visible. But this seems to be ignored and it&apos;s still visible.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;NOTE: Just to be clear, I don&apos;t want to disable Spark UI. I need to be able to see the jobs from Spark UI. Since we don&apos;t offer this feature to our data scientists at our lab, I want to hide this button entirely.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thank you.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Maziyar&lt;/p&gt;</description>
