&lt;p&gt;    Thanks @maziyarpanahi It makes sense to me. I created &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3679&quot; title=&quot;Provide option to allow hide spark ui in frontend&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-3679&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-3679&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for it&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
